title: The Psalms of David's Flight, Part 2 – Doeg the Edomite
description: The Psalms of David's Flight, Part 2 of 3 (optional): Doeg the Edomite tells Saul of David at Nob and slays the priests (Psalm 52, 1 Samuel 21-22), the Doeg study and the Psalm 52 study read in full, in the King James Bible.
